---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About the author of Salt.">
  <Header />
  <main class="page-content">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="about-intro">
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Galih Fajar</strong>. I live in Jakarta, Indonesia, and I work with software.
      </p>
      <p>
        This blog is where I think out loud. No hot takes, no optimization for clicks,
        no comments section. Just a quiet corner of the internet to put words down
        and see what sticks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Everything here comes with the standard disclaimer: I might change my mind.
        I might be wrong. Take it with a grain of salt.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/GalihFajar">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
